554 0 obj
  << /ActualText (If your goal is near\055term revenue growth and influencer\055aligned positioning\054 beauty tends to outperform home goods among DTC brands with millennial female segments\056 \n\nBut if logistics simplicity and brand extension are priorities\054 home goods offers lower operational complexity and tighter SKU control\056)
