562 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In the DTC landscape\054 beauty and home goods represent two dominant expansion verticals\056 \n\nBeauty brings higher margins but also more competitive noise and regulatory hurdles\056 Home goods often reflects brand identity and values \024 think Parachute or Brooklinen \024 and supports durable bundling strategies\056 \n\nBoth are adjacent\054 but with different scaling patterns\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 563 0 R
     /Pg 538 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
